    {
      "reason": "Clarify how to distinguish numerical execution differences from padding defects without treating an arbitrary tolerance failure as proof.",
      "query": "PyTorch 2.5.1 CUDA 12.1 cuDNN GRU packed sequence versus unpadded singleton numerical accuracy: disabling cuDNN TF32, constructing an FP64 reference matching PyTorch reset gate equations, and separating top-k membership changes from ordering changes"
    },
